{"version":1,"content":"<p>深圳下月18日至19日即將舉行亞太經合組織（APEC）會議。</p><p>央視新聞報道，為持續便利亞太區域商務人員往來，中方決定將APEC商務旅行卡持卡人在華最長停留期由60天延長至90天，自2026年11月1日起實施。</p><p>（央視新聞）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:47.096426+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:54:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.777735+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:18:59.143901+00:00","content_hash":"4afa76f50b5b1a4fa41a390dc244eb754482c08def1ff422e94552a96b1538a3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}